{
  "info": {
    "name": "Weduu - Desafio Webhook",
    "description": "Rotas do serviço (localhost) e da plataforma Weduu. Variáveis da coleção: baseUrl (serviço), platformUrl, webhookUrl (URL do ngrok), cid, token e run_id. Os requests de register e burst gravam cid, token e run_id automaticamente. Para obter SKUs reais de um lote, abra o inspetor do ngrok em http://localhost:4040 e veja o corpo das chamadas POST /process.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000"
    },
    {
      "key": "platformUrl",
      "value": "https://dev-wdu-ped-test-1014944555984.us-central1.run.app"
    },
    {
      "key": "webhookUrl",
      "value": "https://SUA-URL.ngrok-free.dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "cid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "run_id",
      "value": "r1"
    },
    {
      "key": "sku",
      "value": "sku-001"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Meu serviço (localhost)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /check - ecoa o token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('devolve o mesmo token', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().token).to.eql('abc123'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"abc123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/check"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /process - mensagem nova (ACK rápido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));",
                  "pm.test('ACK abaixo de 600 ms', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(600));",
                  "pm.test('não é duplicata', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().duplicate).to.eql(false));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"run_id\": \"{{run_id}}\",\n  \"seq\": 0,\n  \"sku\": \"sku-001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/process"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /process - repetir a mesma mensagem (duplicata)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('2xx mesmo sendo duplicata', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));",
                  "pm.test('marcada como duplicata', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().duplicate).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"run_id\": \"{{run_id}}\",\n  \"seq\": 0,\n  \"sku\": \"sku-001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/process"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /process - corpo inválido (espera 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"run_id\": \"{{run_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/process"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /runs/:id - estado do lote",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/runs/{{run_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /burst - gatilho local (precisa estar registrado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/burst"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Plataforma Weduu (real)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /register (precisa do serviço + ngrok no ar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cid', j.cid);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Frederyco\",\n  \"webhook\": \"{{webhookUrl}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{platformUrl}}/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /burst/:cid - pede lote direto à plataforma",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('run_id', pm.response.json().run_id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-token",
                "value": "{{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{platformUrl}}/burst/{{cid}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /enrich/:sku (troque pelo SKU de um lote real; sku-001 só existe no mock)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-cid",
                "value": "{{cid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-token",
                "value": "{{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{platformUrl}}/enrich/{{sku}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200, 404 (sku inválido), 429 ou 500 são respostas válidas do contrato', () => pm.expect([200,404,429,500]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
                  "pm.test('latência dentro do esperado (400-800 ms) quando 200', () => { if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /callback (envia um resultado e recebe o relatório)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json(), null, 2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "content-type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-token",
                "value": "{{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cid\": \"{{cid}}\",\n  \"run_id\": \"{{run_id}}\",\n  \"result\": [\n    { \"seq\": 0, \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\", \"price\": 149.9, \"stock\": 42 }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{platformUrl}}/callback",
            "description": "Pode ser enviado várias vezes para o mesmo run_id; cada envio gera um relatório novo. Com um único item o relatório mostrará itens faltando, o que serve para ver o formato. O envio completo é feito pelo serviço (npm run demo:real)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}